.TH KINTSUGI-MODELS 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-models \- list providers and models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi models
.br
.B kintsugi models
import <file> [\-\-write]
.br
.B kintsugi models
fetch <provider> [\-\-write]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List configured providers and models, import model catalogs, or fetch a
provider's model list.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-write\fR
Persist changes to config
.SH EXAMPLES
List all models:
.PP
  $ kintsugi models
.PP
Import a model catalog:
.PP
  $ kintsugi models import models.json --write
.PP
Fetch models from a provider:
.PP
  $ kintsugi models fetch ollama --write
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-connect (1)
